<form method="post" action="/admin/cloud-settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<div class="card"><h3>每日会员权益返积分</h3>
  <p class="muted">会员权益生效期间,用户可通过签到或「领取每日返积分」获得积分,计入用户积分余额。过期后不可领取。</p>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row"><label>每日返积分数量</label><input type="number" name="cloud_daily_points" value="<%= s.cloud_daily_points %>" min="0" required></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="card"><h3>一级直推(消费返积分)</h3>
  <p class="muted">仅一级:直推好友购买「激活商品」并支付成功后,推荐人若会员权益生效,按比例获得积分。可分别开关白银/黄金档。</p>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row"><label>白银档直推比例(%)</label><input type="number" step="0.1" name="cloud_referral_pct_silver" value="<%= s.cloud_referral_pct_silver %>" min="0"></div>
    <div class="form-row"><label>启用白银直推</label><label class="chk"><input type="checkbox" name="cloud_referral_enable_silver" value="1" <%= String(s.cloud_referral_enable_silver)==='1'?'checked':'' %>> 开启</label></div>
    <div class="form-row"><label>黄金档直推比例(%)</label><input type="number" step="0.1" name="cloud_referral_pct_gold" value="<%= s.cloud_referral_pct_gold %>" min="0"></div>
    <div class="form-row"><label>启用黄金直推</label><label class="chk"><input type="checkbox" name="cloud_referral_enable_gold" value="1" <%= String(s.cloud_referral_enable_gold)==='1'?'checked':'' %>> 开启</label></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="card"><h3>推三返一(一级里程碑)</h3>
  <p class="muted">当直推好友中累计有 3/6/9… 人购买过激活商品时,按商品金额比例发放一次积分奖励。仍为一级,无多级。</p>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row"><label>返还比例(% of 商品金额)</label><input type="number" step="0.1" name="cloud_push3_pct" value="<%= s.cloud_push3_pct %>" min="0"></div>
    <div class="form-row"><label>发放模式</label><select name="cloud_push3_mode"><option value="per_third" <%= s.cloud_push3_mode==='per_third'?'selected':'' %>>每满三人发放一次</option><option value="once" <%= s.cloud_push3_mode==='once'?'selected':'' %>>仅首次满三人发放</option></select></div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="card"><h3>积分兑换展示</h3>
  <p class="muted">仅用于前台展示换算关系,审核通过后扣积分并登记权益,<b>不自动打款、不支持提现</b>。</p>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row"><label>展示名称(如:权益值/云积分)</label><input name="cloud_redeem_label" value="<%= s.cloud_redeem_label %>" required></div>
    <div class="form-row"><label>多少积分 = 1 单位展示值</label><input type="number" name="cloud_redeem_ratio" value="<%= s.cloud_redeem_ratio %>" min="1" required></div>
    <div class="form-row"><label>最低兑换积分数</label><input type="number" name="cloud_redeem_min" value="<%= s.cloud_redeem_min %>" min="1" required></div>
  </div>
</div>
<button class="btn primary" style="padding:9px 30px">保存配置</button>
<a class="btn" href="/admin/cloud-cards">管理卡类型</a>
</form>
